---
const items = [
  "Weddings & private events",
  "Corporate & brand events",
  "Hospitality & retail spaces",
  "Interior styling & installations",
];
---

<section class="create">
  <h2 class="create__heading">What we create</h2>

  <p class="create__body">
    With decades of experience, our team has designed events and spaces for private
    clients and leading brands.<br />
    Each project reflects a balance between creativity, precision and emotion.
  </p>

  <p class="create__intro">We design complete visual experiences for:</p>

  <ol class="create__list">
    {items.map((item, i) => (
      <li>
        <span class="create__n">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
        <span>{item}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .create {
    max-width: var(--container-width);
    padding: 2.5rem var(--gutter) 3.5rem;
  }

  .create__heading {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 2rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .create__body {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .create__intro {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .create__list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    grid-auto-flow: column;
    grid-template-rows: repeat(2, auto);
    column-gap: 2rem;
    row-gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .create__list li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .create__n {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .create__list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      grid-auto-flow: row;
    }
  }
</style>
